ation (`experiment-repo` `prereg/PREREG.md`, commit 7731e49) and the objective (`story-repo`#1). It says what to test and which figure carries which claim; it never says what a result must be. Each claim has a branch for the case it fails — a failing claim is reported as a finding, not repaired.*\n+*Rev. 15, by story-repo (see the revision log). Built from the `Brief` (idea-repo, rev. 10) and the pre-registration (`experiment-repo` `prereg/PREREG.md`, commit 7731e49) and the objective (`story-repo`#1). It says what to test and which figure carries which claim; it never says what a result must be. Each claim has a branch for the case it fails — a failing claim is reported as a finding, not repaired.*\n-**Branch taken (OLB C/T results, G = 10 group folds, 4,507 models/475 families, S = strongest quarter; scores in points, k ≤ 13 of N = 39):** (i) design beats random-k statistically at every k ≤ 13 on both splits and practically (δ_floor = 0.25 × floor ≈ 1.1) only for k ≤ 3 on G and k ≤ 5 on S — the MTEB small-k finding transfers; (ii) the excess over the floor is within 2 points at k = 2 (G) and 3 (S), within 1 point at k = 5 (G) and 13 (S); the floor is 4.8 (G) and 7.2 (S), so a few benchmarks suffice for coarse placement on G and the needed k is larger on S; no margin tighter\n+**Branch taken (OLB C/T results, G = 10 group folds, 4,507 models/475 families, S = strongest quarter; scores in points, k ≤ 13 of N = 39):** (i) design beats random-k statistically at every k ≤ 13 on both splits and practically (δ_floor = 0.25 × floor ≈ 1.1) only for k ≤ 3 on G and k ≤ 5 on S — the MTEB small-k finding transfers; (ii) the excess over the floor is within 2 points at k = 2 (G) and 3 (S), within 1 point at k = 5 (G) and 13 (S); the floor is 4.8 (G) and 7.2 (S), so a few benchmarks suffice for coarse placement on G and the needed k is larger on S; no margin tighter\n+- rev. 15: C7 caveat (iv) carries the uploader-grouping sensitivity (G result does not rest on the family heuristic).\n\nShell cwd was reset to /hutian/repo\n```", "exit": null}}}, {"id": "70644f84-93da-5ceb-a0a0-db24fb949667", "at": 1795740717.8375733, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 86481, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.session/request_permission", "role": "experiment-repo", "actor": "experiment-repo", "execution_id": "c39f8dbc57ce385132104645d5d4c185", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "session/request_permission"}, {"id": "ef9699d0-7f26-53cb-8535-ceb2a8283100", "at": 1795740717.8424602, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 86482, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "experiment-repo", "actor": "experiment-repo", "execution_id": "c39f8dbc57ce385132104645d5d4c185", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "ff94d686-3b35-5c21-bb86-e67eaa97baf0", "at": 1795740717.8458583, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 86483, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.response", "role": "experiment-repo", "actor": "experiment-repo", "execution_id": "c39f8dbc57ce385132104645d5d4c185", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "response"}, {"id": "80863fb2-3cde-51b4-837c-85bd6e2c7a03", "at": 1795740717.8754923, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 86485, "layer": "worker", "category": "challenge", "kind": "authentication.challenge", "role": "experiment-repo", "actor": "unknown", "execution_id": "c39f8dbc57ce385132104645d5d4c185", "trust": "system-confirmed", "outcome": "credential-required", "label": "challenge → credential-required", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "credential challenge GET /world/story-repo.wiki.git/info/refs"}, {"id": "dfe68311-e72f-50c8-8a10-e5cf